-- client_invoice_notes: the tenant policy plus the AD-24 client clause WITH
-- `status <> 'draft'` (the 0062 invoice shape) — a portal session sees its
-- own client's issued and void notes, never a draft. Writes are
-- OPERATOR-ONLY, split per command (`app.client_id` must be unset).
-- client_invoice_note_lines: no client column — a line INHERITS its note's
-- visibility (the EXISTS runs under the notes' own policy).
-- client_invoice_note_series and client_invoice_note_policies: tenant-scoped
